    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d738">

                <pb facs="0766" n="758" sameAs="frus:frus1938v01/pg758"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/603: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-08-03T13:00:00+01:00">August 3, 1938—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 3—9:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>714. From Myron Taylor.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d738-f1"/></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>The Intergovernmental Committee held its first meeting at London this
                        morning and elected Lord Winterton as Chairman;<anchor n="2"
                            xml:id="d738-f2"/> the representatives respectively of the United
                        States, France, Brazil, and the Netherlands as Vice Chairmen and Mr. George
                        Rublee as Director. I made my report and Lord Winterton and Senator Berenger
                        spoke briefly.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Please convey to Mr. Rublee from me a message of congratulation upon his
                        election to the important and honorable position of Director. I am deeply
                        gratified that he has accepted this responsibility and I wish him to know
                        that he can count upon my cooperation to the fullest extent.
                        [Taylor.]</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d738-f1" n="1" xml:id="d738-f1-content">
                <p>American representative on the Intergovernmental Committee on Political
                    Refugees.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d738-f2" n="2" xml:id="d738-f2-content">
                <p>The Committee held its second session on the morning of August 4, and adjourned
                    subject to call by the Chairman.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
